Package: capsa-embedding-assets-nomic
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nomic embedding GGUF and offline tokenizer cache for Capsa
 This package contains the pinned Nomic Embed Text v1.5 Q4_K_M GGUF and the
 exact Hugging Face cache layout used by Capsa's tokenizer.  Installation does
 not download models or contact Hugging Face.
